  "added": "2026-10-26",
  "summary": "ztOS on the POCO X8 Pro (MediaTek MT6899, Mali-G720 MC8). It boots from slot B next to HyperOS, which stays untouched on slot A. The kernel is the phone's Android GKI 6.6 with Halium. Ubuntu Touch 24.04 runs the Android vendor services, and ztMETRO with the ztOS apps runs from a chroot. ztOS's data lives in a pinned file inside Android's userdata, so nothing is repartitioned. Graphics are hardware accelerated on the Mali through libhybris (ztMETRO, mpv, Firefox and Flatpak apps). Android apps run in Waydroid (LineageOS 23.2 / Android 16) on the same GPU. A rewrite on Arch Linux ARM, ztOS's own base, is coming soon and will replace the Ubuntu Touch layer.",
